# Proxy redirects for the two storefronts -- URL bar stays on this portfolio domain while the
# actual page is served from each storefront's own separate Netlify site/repo. Documented in both
# storefronts' own READMEs (2026-08-22) but never actually added here until now (2026-08-28).
# Must come before the SPA catch-all below -- Netlify _redirects matches top-down, first hit wins.
/photography/*    https://photography-storefront.netlify.app/:splat    200!
/3d-printing/*    https://3d-printing-storefront.netlify.app/:splat    200!

# SPA fallback -- client-side React Router routes 404 on direct load/refresh without this.
/*    /index.html   200
